<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_11> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_11> <https://schema.org/text> "Any practitioner exempted under subsection (10) shall be issued a certificate in the prescribed form as evidence of his exemption. Registered practitioner"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
