<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_9> <https://schema.org/text> "The Council shall revoke the provisional registration of a practitioner if he fails to complete the period of residency under subsection (5) or any extension under subsection (8)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
