<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_27__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The decision of the Council shall specify the grounds for the revocation of registration including the time when the affected registered practitioner may apply to be re-registered."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
