<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A registered practitioner whose registration has been revoked may after the expiry of thirty-six months or such other time as may be specified in the grounds and decisions for revocation made under section 27, apply to the Council to be re-registered."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
