<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Council may re-register the person under subsection (1) if he is satisfied that the reasons or grounds for the revocation of registration made under section 27 are unlikely to recur or that the person has now satisfied the registration requirements."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
