<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IX__cl_51__subsec_10> <https://schema.org/text> "The court may, in addition, order the Council to enter the details of the practitioner into a register of black-listed practitioners, and such persons shall not be permitted to practice a recognised practice area or be a director or officer of a company involved in providing traditional and complementary medicine or a partner in a partnership of practitioners, until the expiry of a period of two years from the date of his conviction."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
