<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who tampers, alters, removes, breaks or modifies any mark, seal, sign, barrier, lock, device to or any item which will indicate that the premises, building or facility is subject to a closure order, or in any other way contravenes the closure order, commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_5__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
