<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Traditional and Complementary Medicine Act 2012."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
