<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_I__cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Private Healthcare Facilities and Services Act 1998 [Act 586] shall not apply to the practice of traditional and complementary medicine including the use of any premises, building and facility for such medical practice. Interpretation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
