<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The Council may, in any case, make such order as the Council thinks fit with regard to the payment of the costs of the Registrar and of any complainant or of a registered practitioner, and any costs awarded may be recovered as a civil debt. Appeal against orders of the Council"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
