<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_29__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "A registered practitioner shall not use any title or abbreviation which has been prohibited by the Council under subsection (3)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_29__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_29> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
