<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_29__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The Council shall, if the practitioner, within twenty-four months of being placed on the watch-list register, uses a prohibited title or abbreviation, revoke the registration of such practitioner. Duty to refer patient to medical or dental practitioner"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
