<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An acute medical emergency is a medical condition which is sudden, unanticipated and urgent, requiring immediate medical or surgical evalution or treatment for the relief of acute, pain and suffering of the patient."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_30> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
