<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subsection (1), if the patient or the guardian or representative of such patient by written notice duly consents not to be referred, then the practitioner shall not be obliged to refer the patient to a medical or dental practitioner."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
