<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_10> <https://schema.org/text> "The whole or part of the governance and practice code shall be invalid to the extent of any conflict or inconsistency with the mandatory practice standards."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_35> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
