<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Council shall prescribe the mandatory practice standards, for the purpose of the governance and practice codes which are to be complied which by registered practitioners."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_35> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
