<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "All mandatory practice standards shall be published and recorded in register."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/eng@> .
